---
import { whatsapp } from '../../config/site';
---

<section id="participe" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-blue py-20 text-white md:py-24">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden opacity-[.11]" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src={whatsapp.icon} alt="" class="absolute -right-16 top-5 h-80 w-80 object-contain brightness-0 invert md:h-[26rem] md:w-[26rem]" />
    <img src={whatsapp.icon} alt="" class="absolute bottom-[-3rem] right-1/4 h-48 w-48 object-contain brightness-0 invert" />
    <img src={whatsapp.icon} alt="" class="absolute left-1/3 top-1/3 h-24 w-24 object-contain brightness-0 invert" />
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-8">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-[1.25fr_.75fr]">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-extrabold uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-brand-yellow">
          <span class="inline-block h-1 w-8 bg-brand-yellow"></span>
          MOBILIZAÇÃO OFICIAL
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.04] md:text-6xl">
          WhatsApp<br /><span class="text-brand-yellow">do Crivella</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/90">
          Receba informações, agenda, encontros e propostas de Marcelo Crivella no Rio de Janeiro para o Senado, diretamente no seu celular.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-white/80">
          Entre na comunidade oficial e acompanhe de perto o trabalho pelo Rio, com diálogo, presença e compromisso com as famílias.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
        <div class="mb-4 text-center text-sm font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-white/75">Rio de Janeiro • Senado</div>
        <div class="flex h-32 w-32 items-center justify-center md:h-44 md:w-44">
          <img src={whatsapp.icon} alt="" class="h-full w-full object-contain brightness-0 invert" />
        </div>
        <a
          href={whatsapp.communityUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="mt-5 inline-flex w-full max-w-xs items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white px-6 py-4 text-center font-extrabold text-brand-blue transition hover:bg-surface hover:shadow-xl"
        >
          Comunidade do Crivella no Zap
          <img src={whatsapp.icon} alt="" class="ml-2 h-5 w-5 object-contain" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
